{"parse": {"title": "末日与末日之后-04", "pageid": 101317, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-03\" title=\"末日与末日之后-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">末日与末日之后-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AB%E6%97%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E-05\" title=\"末日与末日之后-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">末日与末日之后</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8C.97.E6.96.B9.E4.B9.90.E5.9C.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"北方乐土\">北方乐土</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 北方乐土</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Warm Place in the North</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>唔……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>悦耳的轻微金属碰撞声跃入梦中，库珀花环逐渐从沉睡中醒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这里是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间略显老旧但温暖的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐约能听到窗外仍寒风呼啸，但那似乎与这一小方天地无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环从床铺上支起身子，厚实的毛毯从胸前滑落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……怪不得这么暖和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同行者携着略带重量的居所跳上她的肚子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>你终于醒了，吓死我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>要是你出了什么事，那几个家伙非得把我做成蝾螈干不可……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>诶诶，先别下床！她说你需要让手脚多暖和一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>“她”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她顺着含章鼎示意的方向望去，一个三十多岁的妇人正巧从像是厨房的角落转了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>是呀，孩子。你先躺着吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>冻伤的地方已经处理过了，但捂热乎些药膏才能更好地生效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>来，毯子盖好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>哦，好的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人的语气亲昵而自然，库珀花环微怔后，老老实实地躺回了床上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是您救了我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我不知道该如何感谢您才好。<br />如果没有您，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盛着热菜汤、面包和烤香肠的托盘被放在库珀花环的床头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>任谁看到雪地里有人倒下都会做一样的事的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>好了，先吃点东西吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>拉瑞莎的手艺不错，我刚才已经替你试过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环直起上半身，将托盘放在了自己的腿上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她本来不觉得饿，但此时食物的香味钻入口鼻之中，肚子立刻咕咕叫了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>那我不客气了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烤香肠和面包一起填满了空荡荡的胃袋，热乎乎的菜汤下肚后，整个人都暖和了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笼罩在心头的阴霾竟也消散了大半，身上又涌现出了气力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>怎么样？有没有感觉好一些？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是的……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我好多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的妇人却蹙起了眉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>可孩子，你的表情不是这样说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环哑然了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自责和羞愧与热汤碗上的雾气一同浮起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我只是没想到……会这样轻易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>原来只需要一碗热汤，一张毛毯……伤痛就会逐渐淡去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>失去重要的事物，和珍爱的人再也无法相见……<br />但最终，人们还是能够若无其事地继续生活下去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手在颤抖，双眼却干涩无比。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时若能落下泪来，也许她多少会感到少许宽慰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>大家都是如此吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>还是说——只有我这样的……无情？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>香灰化身而成的小生物欲言又止，屋内一时间只剩下从门缝中钻入的风声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但片刻后，一双温热手掌抚上库珀花环的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>没有那回事，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>我不知道你的身上发生了什么，但我想你是个坚强的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>坚强是没有错的，那些爱着你的人绝不会因此责备你。<br />所以——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那双手捧上库珀花环的脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>抬起头来吧，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那双蓝色的眼睛就像是透亮的天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环忽然感到，自己像是在哪里见过这双眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在弄清自己究竟想要说什么之前，她便已张口——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但忽然，世界被黑暗吞没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>物理意义上的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-633311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-633311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-633311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>怎么回事，灯怎么灭了——诶哟！我磕到什么地方了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>哎呀！一定是发电机出故障了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-633510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>那台机器是好几年前钻井那边淘汰下来的，上个月刚修过，没想到又出毛病了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-633501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>让我们先点起蜡烛来吧。<br />我记得还有一根，稍等……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗中传来翻箱倒柜的声音，片刻后，微弱的烛光亮起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>好了，这下咱们至少能够看到彼此了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>只是不知道能不能坚持到外面的雪停……唉，这下难办了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>发电机……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>略作思索后，库珀花环掀开了身上的毯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>也许我能够修好它。我能看看吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "末日与末日之后-04"}}